{"title":"Career Roadmap · Wellness Centre Manager","role":"Wellness Centre Manager","summary":"A Wellness Centre Manager oversees the day-to-day operations of a wellness, naturopathy, yoga, holistic health, retreat, or integrative wellness centre. The role combines wellness knowledge, centre administration, client experience, staff coordination, safety, service quality, and business operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"BNYS (Naturopathy & Yogic Sciences)","Course":"Naturopathy & Yoga"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Wellness Centre Manager oversees the day-to-day operations of a wellness, naturopathy, yoga, holistic health, retreat, or integrative wellness centre. The role combines wellness knowledge, centre administration, client experience, staff coordination, safety, service quality, and business operations."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BNYS graduate, the pathway can be particularly relevant because the degree provides a foundation in naturopathy, yoga, lifestyle management and wellness-oriented healthcare."},{"type":"p","text":"The manager's responsibilities can include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Managing centre operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Coordinating doctors/practitioners, yoga instructors and therapists"},{"type":"h","text":"Designing wellness programs"},{"type":"h","text":"Managing appointments and client schedules"},{"type":"h","text":"Maintaining service quality"},{"type":"h","text":"Supervising hygiene and safety procedures"},{"type":"h","text":"Managing staff rosters"},{"type":"h","text":"Handling inventory and vendors"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring revenue and expenses"},{"type":"h","text":"Managing customer relationships"},{"type":"h","text":"Developing wellness packages"},{"type":"h","text":"Coordinating residential wellness retreats"},{"type":"h","text":"Using digital tools for centre management"},{"type":"h","text":"Monitoring customer feedback and operational KPIs"},{"type":"note","label":"Important scope note","text":"A Wellness Centre Manager may have administrative responsibility without independently diagnosing or treating patients. Clinical services must be delivered by appropriately qualified professionals within their permitted scope and applicable regulations."}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BNYS"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical & Wellness Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Compulsory Internship / Practical Training"},{"type":"flow","items":["Yoga","Naturopathy","Lifestyle Practice Exposure"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Centre / Hospital / Retreat Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Coordinator / Centre Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Assistant Wellness Centre Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Centre Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Wellness Manager / Operations Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Regional / Multi-Centre Wellness Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Alternative pathway"},{"type":"h","text":"BNYS"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Entrepreneurship"},{"type":"h","text":"Small Wellness Studio / Yoga Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrated Wellness Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-Service Wellness Business"}]},{"heading":"What You Learn During BNYS","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Build the basic scientific and naturopathic foundation."},{"type":"h","text":"Academic areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Human Anatomy"},{"type":"h","text":"Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Biochemistry"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic pathology"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga philosophy"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy principles"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Introduction to natural therapies"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic psychology"},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Management skills to begin developing"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Presentation skills"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Basic accounting"},{"type":"h","text":"Customer service"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Clinical & Wellness Knowledge"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop stronger knowledge of naturopathy and yoga-based wellness."},{"type":"h","text":"Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga therapy fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition and dietetics"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle management"},{"type":"h","text":"Hydrotherapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Mud therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Massage and therapeutic techniques"},{"type":"h","text":"Physical culture"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Community health"},{"type":"h","text":"Psychology and behavioural wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Practical exposure"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how wellness sessions are planned, delivered and documented under supervision."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Clinical Integration"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop the ability to understand wellness programs and coordinate different services."},{"type":"h","text":"Focus areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Therapeutic yoga"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathic therapies"},{"type":"h","text":"Diet planning"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle modification"},{"type":"h","text":"Stress management"},{"type":"h","text":"Exercise and physical activity"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive health"},{"type":"h","text":"Health education"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient/client communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Case documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Management development"},{"type":"h","text":"Start learning:"},{"type":"h","text":"Appointment management"},{"type":"h","text":"Client onboarding"},{"type":"h","text":"Staff coordination"},{"type":"h","text":"Service scheduling"},{"type":"h","text":"Inventory management"},{"type":"h","text":"Quality control"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year — Internship & Professional Preparation"},{"type":"p","text":"The final phase should combine clinical exposure with operational experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Priorities"},{"type":"h","text":"Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical observation"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness-centre exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga program delivery under supervision"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition counselling exposure"},{"type":"h","text":"Client communication"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness retreat operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"h","text":"Case discussions"},{"type":"h","text":"Health education programs"},{"type":"p","text":"For someone specifically targeting Wellness Centre Manager, an additional internship in the operations/administration side of a wellness centre is highly valuable."}]},{"heading":"Core Professional Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Naturopathy"},{"text":"Natural wellness principles, therapeutic approaches, lifestyle management"}],[{"text":"Yoga"},{"text":"Yoga practice, therapeutic yoga, session planning"}],[{"text":"Nutrition"},{"text":"Nutrition fundamentals, wellness diet planning"}],[{"text":"Wellness"},{"text":"Preventive health, stress management, lifestyle programs"}],[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Scheduling, staffing, service coordination"}],[{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Team leadership, delegation, performance management"}],[{"text":"Client Experience"},{"text":"Counselling communication, feedback handling, customer service"}],[{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"Hygiene, emergency procedures, risk identification"}],[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Budgeting, expenses, revenue tracking"}],[{"text":"Marketing"},{"text":"Wellness packages, digital marketing, social media"}],[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"CRM, scheduling software, Excel, dashboards"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Decision-making, conflict resolution, team motivation"}]]}]},{"heading":"Wellness Centre Management Workflo